---
// src/components/Facilities.astro
// High-End Architectural Amenities Clustering with Double-Bezel Enclosures
---

<!-- ==================== FASILITAS KOMPREHENSIF (DOUBLE-BEZEL CLUSTERING) ==================== -->
<section class="py-24 sm:py-32 bg-surface-subtle/40 border-b border-border-stone relative overflow-hidden" id="fasilitas">
  
  <!-- Subtle Ambient Glows -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/3 -right-32 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-syariah-gold/5 blur-3xl pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-10 -left-32 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-primary/5 blur-3xl pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 xs:px-6 lg:px-10 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Section Header (Editorial Spatial Rhythm & Micro Eyebrow) -->
    <div class="max-w-2xl mb-12 sm:mb-16">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[10px] font-mono font-medium tracking-[0.2em] uppercase bg-syariah-gold/10 text-syariah-gold border border-syariah-gold/25 mb-3">
        Standar &amp; Kenyamanan
      </span>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-normal text-on-surface tracking-tight">
        Dirancang untuk Istirahat Tenang &amp; Ibadah yang Khusyuk
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs xs:text-sm sm:text-base text-on-surface-variant mt-3 leading-relaxed">
        Fasilitas esensial di kamar tidur privat dan area bersama untuk ketenangan dan kenyamanan optimal Anda sekeluarga.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Clusters in High-End Double-Bezel Enclosures -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8">
      
      <!-- Cluster 1: Kenyamanan Kamar Pribadi (Isi 2 Orang) -->
      <div class="p-2 sm:p-2.5 rounded-[2.25rem] bg-stone-200/40 ring-1 ring-stone-300/60 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.03)] hover:shadow-[0_24px_48px_-12px_rgba(40,54,43,0.12)] hover:ring-syariah-gold/30 hover:bg-syariah-gold/5 transition-all duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.32,0.72,0,1)] hover:-translate-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-[calc(2.25rem-0.5rem)] bg-white shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.9)] h-full flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-5">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-surface-subtle border border-border-stone text-primary flex items-center justify-center shadow-2xs">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">bed</span>
              </div>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold text-primary bg-primary-light px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-primary/20 shadow-2xs">01</span>
            </div>
            
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-on-surface">Kamar Pribadi (AC &amp; KM Dalam)</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-1.5 mb-6 leading-relaxed font-sans">
              Kapasitas 2 orang per kamar. Bersih, hening, dan privat untuk istirahat berkualitas.
            </p>

            <ul class="space-y-4 text-xs text-on-surface-variant font-mono">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">ac_unit</span>
                <div>
                  <strong class="text-on-surface block font-sans font-semibold text-xs">AC Dingin &amp; Senyap</strong>
                  <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-sans block text-xs">Terawat berkala di setiap kamar tidur.</span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">hot_tub</span>
                <div>
                  <strong class="text-on-surface block font-sans font-semibold text-xs">Kamar Mandi Dalam &amp; Water Heater</strong>
                  <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-sans block text-xs">Air panas 24 jam dengan aliran lancar.</span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">tv</span>
                <div>
                  <strong class="text-on-surface block font-sans font-semibold text-xs">TV &amp; WiFi Fiber Cepat</strong>
                  <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-sans block text-xs">Koneksi internet stabil untuk santai atau kerja.</span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">dentistry</span>
                <div>
                  <strong class="text-on-surface block font-sans font-semibold text-xs">Amenities Lengkap</strong>
                  <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-sans block text-xs">Handuk bersih, sabun, dan dental kit baru.</span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">coffee</span>
                <div>
                  <strong class="text-on-surface block font-sans font-semibold text-xs">Air Mineral, Teh &amp; Kopi</strong>
                  <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-sans block text-xs">Disediakan gratis untuk tamu yang menginap.</span>
                </div>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Cluster 2: Dapur Mini & Ibadah -->
      <div class="p-2 sm:p-2.5 rounded-[2.25rem] bg-stone-200/40 ring-1 ring-stone-300/60 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.03)] hover:shadow-[0_24px_48px_-12px_rgba(40,54,43,0.12)] hover:ring-syariah-gold/30 hover:bg-syariah-gold/5 transition-all duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.32,0.72,0,1)] hover:-translate-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-[calc(2.25rem-0.5rem)] bg-white shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.9)] h-full flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-5">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-surface-subtle border border-border-stone text-syariah-gold flex items-center justify-center shadow-2xs">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">soup_kitchen</span>
              </div>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold text-amber-800 bg-amber-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-200/60 shadow-2xs">02</span>
            </div>
            
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-on-surface">Dapur Bersama &amp; Mushola</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-1.5 mb-6 leading-relaxed font-sans">
              Kenyamanan praktis dan ruang ibadah seperti di rumah sendiri.
            </p>

            <ul class="space-y-4 text-xs text-on-surface-variant font-mono">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-syariah-gold shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">soup_kitchen</span>
                <div>
                  <strong class="text-on-surface block font-sans font-semibold text-xs">Dapur Mini (Kompor &amp; Kulkas)</strong>
                  <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-sans block text-xs">Untuk menghangatkan bekal atau memasak praktis.</span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-syariah-gold shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">water_drop</span>
                <div>
                  <strong class="text-on-surface block font-sans font-semibold text-xs">Dispenser Galon Gratis</strong>
                  <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-sans block text-xs">Air panas &amp; dingin bebas isi ulang sewaktu-waktu.</span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-syariah-gold shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">mosque</span>
                <div>
                  <strong class="text-on-surface block font-sans font-semibold text-xs">Mushola &amp; Tempat Wudhu</strong>
                  <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-sans block text-xs">Bersih, lengkap sajadah, mukena, dan sarung.</span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-syariah-gold shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">deck</span>
                <div>
                  <strong class="text-on-surface block font-sans font-semibold text-xs">Balkon &amp; Koridor Asri</strong>
                  <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-sans block text-xs">Area santai lantai atas dengan udara sejuk dan sofa jati.</span>
                </div>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Cluster 3: Parkir Mobil & Keamanan -->
      <div class="p-2 sm:p-2.5 rounded-[2.25rem] bg-stone-200/40 ring-1 ring-stone-300/60 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.03)] hover:shadow-[0_24px_48px_-12px_rgba(40,54,43,0.12)] hover:ring-syariah-gold/30 hover:bg-syariah-gold/5 transition-all duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.32,0.72,0,1)] hover:-translate-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-[calc(2.25rem-0.5rem)] bg-white shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.9)] h-full flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-5">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-surface-subtle border border-border-stone text-secondary flex items-center justify-center shadow-2xs">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">directions_car</span>
              </div>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold text-stone-700 bg-stone-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs">03</span>
            </div>
            
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-on-surface">Parkir &amp; Keamanan</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-1.5 mb-6 leading-relaxed font-sans">
              Aman, tertib, dan terjaga di dalam pekarangan penginapan tertutup.
            </p>

            <ul class="space-y-4 text-xs text-on-surface-variant font-mono">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-secondary shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">local_parking</span>
                <div>
                  <strong class="text-on-surface block font-sans font-semibold text-xs">Parkir Mobil &amp; Motor di Dalam Pagar</strong>
                  <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-sans block text-xs">Halaman paving luas dan aman, bukan di pinggir jalan.</span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-secondary shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">smoke_free</span>
                <div>
                  <strong class="text-on-surface block font-sans font-semibold text-xs">Bebas Asap Rokok di Kamar</strong>
                  <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-sans block text-xs">Udara kamar bersih, higienis, dan ramah keluarga.</span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-secondary shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">door_front</span>
                <div>
                  <strong class="text-on-surface block font-sans font-semibold text-xs">Gerbang Tertutup Malam Hari</strong>
                  <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-sans block text-xs">Lingkungan hening, tertib, dan terjaga keamanannya.</span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-secondary shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">support_agent</span>
                <div>
                  <strong class="text-on-surface block font-sans font-semibold text-xs">Pengelola Siaga (Bu Agnesia)</strong>
                  <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-sans block text-xs">Respon cepat via WhatsApp untuk segala kebutuhan menginap.</span>
                </div>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
